  "description": "Portable AI-connector wire substrate — the minimal surface a Fuaran host needs to speak an AI provider's own wire format without taking a dependency on any platform SDK: an insertion-ordered JsonValue model with a byte-stable canonical writer, a host-bridged parser (System.Text.Json on .NET, JSON.parse under Fable), the provider message / tool / response / error contract, and a one-method IHttpTransport egress seam. FSharp.Core only — no System.Net.Http, no host APIs — so the same source drives a .NET server host and a Fable browser host. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
